This project is an independent tool for launching Sider (a companion
program for Pro Evolution Soccer 2021 by the pes-modding project,
https://github.com/pes-modding/sider7) on Linux. It does not include, modify,
or redistribute any code, binaries, or assets from that project, or from
Konami/eFootball/Pro Evolution Soccer. See README.md for details.
